  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_258944.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcustomized-dungeon-loot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/customized-dungeon-loot?logo=modrinth&amp;label=&amp;suffix= &amp;style=flat&amp;color=242629&amp;labelColor=5ca424&amp;logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/258944(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Supported Versions\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ycRJJk8EXV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&amp;logo=discord&amp;style=flat&amp;label=&amp;labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/BpeRWHD.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"400\"><br><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line_curved.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>📖 模組說明</h2><p>將 Minecraft 中各種結構的儲物箱填入修改過的原始戰利品，讓你找到更多獨特且特別的物品！</p><hr><h4>特色：</h4><ul>\n<li>不新增任何物品與方塊！這代表即使你之後刪除這個模組，你仍然會擁有所有自訂物品！</li>\n<li>原始物品擁有自己的名稱、描述、附魔、屬性與組件</li>\n<li>戰利品會生成在許多不同的結構中，並符合該結構的主題</li>\n</ul><hr><h4>建立或修改你自己的戰利品：</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>你可以新增或刪除你自己的物品到遊戲中！你只需要修改模組內的 <code>loot_table.json</code> 檔案即可。（僅適合進階使用者！）</p><p>或者，你也可以簡單地修改物品的生成機率或數值。</p><hr><h4>使用資料包（適用於較新版本）：</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>使用這個基礎資料包並進行修改：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot/files/3878801\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.x</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h4>透過編輯模組檔案本身：</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li>\n<p>開啟模組壓縮檔 (Customized Dungeon Loot.jar)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>（<strong>在 1.12 版本中</strong>）前往資料夾：<code>assets\\customizeddungeonloot\\loot_tables</code></p>\n</li>\n</ul><p>（<strong>在 1.14 及更高版本中</strong>）前往資料夾：<code>data\\minecraft\\loot_tables</code></p><ul>\n<li>然後修改你需要的 <code>loot_table.json</code> 檔案。</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h4>如果你不知道如何編輯戰利品表，這裡有一些小提示：</h4><ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmisode.github.io%252floot-table%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://misode.github.io/loot-table/</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fminecraft.gamepedia.com%252fLoot_table\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://minecraft.gamepedia.com/Loot_table</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmod%252flds-loottable-generator%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.planetminecraft.com/mod/lds-loottable-generator/</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>📷 展示</h2><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/vsdPkFe.png\" alt=\"loot review\"></p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/WuBe645.png\" alt=\"loot review\"></p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/OklzRVM.png\" alt=\"loot review\"></p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/QCeN5gb.png\" alt=\"loot review\"></p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/W3npXYl.png\" alt=\"loot review\"></p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/BFaBN6x.png\" alt=\"loot review\"></p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/o0mt7Ug.png\" alt=\"loot review\"></p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/c5lucz1.png\" alt=\"loot review\"></p><p><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入內容已移除：<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2fuc27Ea33l_0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/uc27Ea33l_0</a> </span></span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>🗃️ 依賴項目</h2><h3>必要：</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>Magma Core</strong> [≥ MC 1.21.5]\n<ul>\n<li>提供基礎程式碼與功能，例如更新檢查器</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magma-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmagma-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>🎮 我的其他模組！</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Additional Structures\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-miner\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Bedrock-Miner/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Bedrock Miner\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-upgrades\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ToolUpgrades/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Tool Upgrades\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"All The Compatibility\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/2291f5f13114f09294ce5e079f8a61b8a2617a8692e68ca453674e93f1982b62/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f427065525748442e706e67\" alt=\"Customized Dungeon Loot\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-sticks\" rel